<title>CANADA: Cominco files for US$300 mln debt offer.</title>
<headline>Cominco files for US$300 mln debt offer.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mining concern Cominco Ltd said on Friday it filed with regulators in Canada and the United States to offer up to US$300 million in debt securities in the United States.</p>
<p>It also filed a supplement to the shelf prospectus re-establishing its U.S. medium term note facility.  But it said it has no intention at the present time of issuing any debt securities under the shelf prospectus or its medium term note program.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Vancouver Bureau (604) 664-7314</p>
</text>
